ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75530717_539452207635527_5225632817684849203_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cGX5Ct7wMg8Q7kNvwH_G3ob&_nc_oc=AdoxtfCUJFhsZn6Y2h9TS3tphb5sy6Gk4tQbrnpR_H_Lk_RL_Z15AtjUe4jozg2keD8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQnhOMgsR_UMe9xBGpmcuw5udXEO4D_8JdJ-7nZoSk34A&oe=6B0DA8BE"}, {"file_name": "007.png", "id": "668633428071536", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982547_668633431404869_6728926765491185979_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bNA57mp8_o8Q7kNvwE5fHhi&_nc_oc=AdoJWJyb0Cps28IY7lL_Lp4mXNl6lfD2BwUG0iVeghX-q75-r3RzDMyx8mtB7IzQa2Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSWiUb94SxxuXzLZrbkrwPQlJqWvA0qNOqhMc-bUV6MBA&oe=6B0D9D3F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ultimate Glove Ball", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Charge in and knock 'em out! Party up and hit the court for a three minute match of manic multiplayer dodgeball. You'll be racing to snag ammo, dodge incoming fire, and blast your opponents into the digital afterlife with a well timed orb of electric doom.\n\nEasy to pick up but challenging to master, Ultimate Glove Ball will test your timing, tactics, and tenacity.\n\n- Up to 3v3 Multiplayer\n- Quick 3 minute matches\n- 5 Ball types with unique abilities\n- Furious tactical gameplay\n- Spectator mode\n\nUGB is a showcase project for Meta Quest developers. Source code and assets can be found on GitHub at https://github.com/oculus-samples/Unity-UltimateGloveBall.\n\n- Oculus Social Platform Features (Invites, Group Launch, Group Presence, Blocking flow)\n- Meta Avatar integration\n- Oculus Audio Spatialization\n- Photon VOIP spatialized\n- Multiple Region support\n", "short_description": "Charge in and knock 'em out! Party up and hit the court for a three minute match of manic multiplayer dodgeball. You'll race to s